@startuml
title Human-approved application workflow

actor Candidate
participant "API Service" as API
participant "ACP Orchestrator" as ACP
participant "Resume Optimizer" as Optimizer
participant "Cover Letter Agent" as Letter
participant "Application Service" as Applications
participant "Browser / ATS MCP" as MCP

Candidate -> API: Prepare application(jobId)
API -> ACP: Start workflow(profile snapshot, job snapshot)
ACP -> Optimizer: Tailor verified Resume JSON
Optimizer --> ACP: Structured proposal + confidence + provenance
ACP -> Letter: Draft cover letter
Letter --> ACP: Draft + validation result
ACP --> API: Awaiting approval(package reference)
API --> Candidate: Show package and changes
Candidate -> API: Approve package
API -> Applications: Persist approval and idempotency key
Applications -> ACP: Resume submission workflow
ACP -> MCP: Submit approved package
MCP --> ACP: Confirmation evidence or ambiguous result
ACP -> Applications: Persist submitted/manual-review state
Applications --> Candidate: Status notification
@enduml
